#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0136B expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "SHIFT1N (the dependent) is absent. SHIFT1 seeds tuple y=1 so the expansion runs and SHIFT1N is synthesised absent; no Requirements.Variables block on this rule, so nothing skips it. noViolation WITH THE RULE EXECUTING - contrast with the sibling skipped_no_shift_columns fixture. Silent for two reasons: not empty(SHIFT1N) is false over the absent column, and compileHasMultipleValuesFor short-circuits on a negative dependent index."
